@baseUrl = http://localhost:5126

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. Log in (run this first!)
### Saves the token automatically for the requests below.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jonos.frontend@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. Register a new user (no token needed)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. Projects
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get my projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one project, with its issues
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a project
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Created from .http",
  "description": "Testing the API from VS Code"
}

### Get a project's members
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/11/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. Issues
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get issues assigned to me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/issues?assignedToMe=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get open, high-priority issues in project 11
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/issues?projectId=11&status=Open&priority=High
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an issue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "projectId": 11,
  "title": "Created from .http",
  "description": "Testing issue creation",
  "priority": "High"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. Comments
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Add a comment (change issueId to a real issue)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "issueId": 1,
  "content": "Comment from the .http file"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. Users (Admin only)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Try to delete a user who has comments (expect 400)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}